msgid ""
"Connect with a ground station and set the following parameters.  The params "
"below assume the autopilot's telem2 port is used. Parameters shown for use "
"of SERIAL2 port and first MOUNT instance. RC switch channels used can be "
"determined by user."
msgstr ""
"连接地面站并设置以下参数。下面的参数假定使用飞控的 telem2 端口。所示参数适用于使用 SERIAL2 端口和第一个 MOUNT 实例。所用的 RC"
" 开关通道可由用户自行确定。"

